{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 92312, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 64802, "uid": 82806, "type": 4, "title": "点火石挑选", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1637299676, "updated_at": 1639283466, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1639283466, "last_at": 1690079574, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "感谢土星佬提供的国际服点火石挑选攻略，此篇攻略是在国际服基础上修改的适合日服的点火石挑选一图流。基础知识（源自于吟味测试）1.红攻（当为主词条时加成400，副词条时加成300）：增加对敌人的所有技能伤", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637393655474_4652828.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637393580436_63215163.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637393531792_98978897.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 14, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 24489, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 13, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 92312, "content": "<div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">感谢土星佬提供的国际服点火石挑选攻略，此篇攻略是在国际服基础上修改的适合日服的点火石挑选一图流。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">基础知识（源自于吟味测试）</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">1.红攻（当为主词条时加成400，副词条时加成300）：增加对敌人的所有技能伤害，不包括异常和魔力伤害，同时跟攻击力加成BUFF乘算，对NS技能和SS技能伤害增幅效果不同，对NS技能，每100红攻增幅提升≈总攻击力+15%；对SS技能，每100红攻增幅提升≈总攻击力+35%</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">2.红爆（当为主词条时加成400，副词条时加成300）：增加对敌人的所有暴击伤害，以暴击为触发条件，效果略大于增幅敏捷，对NS技能，每50红爆增幅提升≈技能伤害+15%；对SS技能，每50红爆增幅提升≈技能伤害+15%</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">3.红敏（当为主词条时加成400，副词条时加成300）：增加对敌人的所有弱点攻击伤害，以克制属性为触发条件，对NS技能，每50红敏增幅提升≈弱点攻击+15%；对SS技能，每50红敏增幅提升≈弱点攻击+15%</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">简易结论：红攻＞红爆≥红敏</div></div>\n                               </div><br></div><br></span><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:24px;font-weight:700;\">点火石位置图：</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:24px;font-weight:700;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637299980764_4230484.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637299980764_4230484.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">攻击核心评价</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1637300976955_56773192.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/